    },
    "body": "The completed frozen endpoint probe finds no correct first-token winner among 352 physical Source transports and 32 cumulative-query controls on the fresh 32-case panel. Record the audited result and replace the completed discriminator with the next causal implementation: a zero-initialized local query/actual-prefix H4 factor for Generate, compared with existing joint learning on the same full-bank data.\n\nThis is a proposed compatibility intervention, not proof that state separation is necessary or that geometry lacks capacity. Preserve the eight-case prediction control, finite-result scope, complete-answer/value-swap requirements and independent transfer boundary. No production code or model changes.\n\nReferences #820.\n\nValidation: git diff --check and scripts/check_claim_wording.py pass. Numerical results bind RECORD source c3414232bfb2d2111d28d6d04a04715f986e3d6e; its release check/build and all five focused tests pass. Independent evidence review verifies every route/cache/alias reduction and report seal; independent architecture review supports the next candidate with limitations. No Cargo rerun is needed for these two documentation files.\n",
